    "detailed_description": "In a small town in Bad Light County, Police Sergeant Maddy Chistensen will investigate the mysterious disappearance of cattle. He will soon discover that cattle rustlers are not from this planet.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA mysterious electromagnetic pulse has destroyed electrical systems. Vehicles, communications and electricity do not work. You will have to find a way to escape Bad Light County and save its population.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo escape from Estancia La Aurora (The Ranch) you will have to repair an old Land Rover. You will have to find a spark plug, a battery and the key. To find them you will have to follow the clues that you find throughout the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSomewhere in South America, aliens have made contact. But the visitors have not arrived in peace on Planet Earth...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPERMADEATH videogame (no save game). Based on the STEPHEN KING stories<br />\r\nOpen world third person shooter (TPS) game. <br />\r\nSingle player video game, compatible with Windows 8 / 8.1 / 10 / 11<br />\r\nThe game locations are inspired by real places in South America.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRequirements:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nO.S: Windows 10 / Windows 11<br />\r\nVideo: NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070<br />\r\nFree space: 20 GB<br />\r\nRAM: 16GB",
